    "type": "game",
    "name": "Phat Phrog Clicker",
    "steam_appid": 3090990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090990/extras/02c19d46cb468ccab224a7341329a996.avif?t=1721901405\" width=660 height=1000 /></span><br><br><br>Welcome to Phat Phrog Clicker, the adorable idle clicker game that will captivate your heart and keep you clicking for more! This free-to-play adventure invites you to immerse yourself in a world brimming with cute, collectible creatures that you can earn, trade, and collect.<br><br>In Phat Phrog Clicker, every 30 or so minutes you\u2019ll be rewarded with a new, charming Steam inventory creature. Each creature is uniquely designed with delightful features, ensuring your collection is as diverse as it is adorable. With over 25 collectible phrogs, your collection will always have something new and exciting. Legendary skins, which can be crafted, add an extra layer of allure and customization to your collection. Every skin you discover becomes a pet in your own private zoo, adding to the charm and uniqueness of your collection.<br><br>The fun doesn\u2019t stop there \u2013 these creatures aren\u2019t just for show! Engage in a vibrant marketplace where you can trade, buy, and sell your prized possessions, strategically building a collection that stands out among your friends and competitors. Experience the joy of collecting as you unlock rare and exclusive creatures, each adding to the allure of your inventory.<br><br>With simple, intuitive mechanics, Phat Phrog Clicker is perfect for players of all ages. Whether you\u2019re a casual gamer looking to pass the time or a dedicated collector aiming for the top, this game offers endless fun and excitement.<br><br>Join the community of Phat Phrog Clicker enthusiasts today and start your journey towards becoming the ultimate cute creature collector. The world of adorable critters awaits you \u2013 are you ready to click your way to the top?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090990/extras/02c19d46cb468ccab224a7341329a996.avif?t=1721901405\" width=660 height=1000 /></span><br><br><br>Welcome to Phat Phrog Clicker, the adorable idle clicker game that will captivate your heart and keep you clicking for more! This free-to-play adventure invites you to immerse yourself in a world brimming with cute, collectible creatures that you can earn, trade, and collect.<br><br>In Phat Phrog Clicker, every 30 or so minutes you\u2019ll be rewarded with a new, charming Steam inventory creature. Each creature is uniquely designed with delightful features, ensuring your collection is as diverse as it is adorable. With over 25 collectible phrogs, your collection will always have something new and exciting. Legendary skins, which can be crafted, add an extra layer of allure and customization to your collection. Every skin you discover becomes a pet in your own private zoo, adding to the charm and uniqueness of your collection.<br><br>The fun doesn\u2019t stop there \u2013 these creatures aren\u2019t just for show! Engage in a vibrant marketplace where you can trade, buy, and sell your prized possessions, strategically building a collection that stands out among your friends and competitors. Experience the joy of collecting as you unlock rare and exclusive creatures, each adding to the allure of your inventory.<br><br>With simple, intuitive mechanics, Phat Phrog Clicker is perfect for players of all ages. Whether you\u2019re a casual gamer looking to pass the time or a dedicated collector aiming for the top, this game offers endless fun and excitement.<br><br>Join the community of Phat Phrog Clicker enthusiasts today and start your journey towards becoming the ultimate cute creature collector. The world of adorable critters awaits you \u2013 are you ready to click your way to the top?",
    "short_description": "Join the community of Phat Phrog Clicker enthusiasts today and become the ultimate cute creature collector! Earn 28 unique Steam inventory skins, dropping every 30 minutes of gameplay. These skins can be traded or sold on the Steam Marketplace. Can you collect them all?",
